		"description": "<p>Long knives, often needle-like, hollow, or with a specially-shaped fuller to allow a toxic substance to run easily along the blade’s length, these blades are carefully designed and made to deliver a toxic substance with a sharp stab or deep scratch. These toxins are often extracted from dangerous animals or concocted from plant extracts by experts in Dreamer communities.</p><p>The profile for poisoned blades can be found in the Hand-Made Weapons Table at the start of this section. A poisoned blade cannot inflict Injuries on machine enemies.</p>",
